%U A398330 81778736556148338,1752285403838758110,39232878907643179554,916393316927891151390,22296432130304950015185
%N A398330 One-half of the number of permutations p of [n] having exactly four runs of adjacent entries differing by 1.
%C A398330 A run is a maximal contiguous block p(i),p(i+1),...,p(j), with j>i, such that |p(h+1)-p(h)|=1 for every i<=h<j.
%H A398330 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A398330/b398330.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 8..450</a>
%F A398330 a(n) = A398328(n,4)/2.
%F A398330 G.f.: (1/(1-x)^12) * Sum_{k>=0} k! * (-(1+x)^3*binomial(k+1,1)^2 + 12*(1+x)^2*binomial(k+2,2)^2 - 72*(1+x)*binomial(k+3,3)^2 + 192*binomial(k+4,4)^2) * (x*(1-x)/(1+x))^(k+8).
%o A398330 (PARI) my(N=20, x='x+O('x^N)); Vec(sum(k=0, N, k!*(-(1+x)^3*binomial(k+1, 1)^2+12*(1+x)^2*binomial(k+2, 2)^2-72*(1+x)*binomial(k+3, 3)^2+192*binomial(k+4, 4)^2)*(x*(1-x)/(1+x))^(k+8))/(1-x)^12)
%Y A398330 Cf. A398328.
%K A398330 nonn,new
%O A398330 8,1
%A A398330 _Seiichi Manyama_, Sep 01 2026
